WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.166
[sighs]

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.625
Well, none of this will matter

00:00:02.708 --> 00:00:04.458
if you don't make
that bloody hammer.

00:00:04.541 --> 00:00:06.291
Why can't you just wave
your fingers like a wizard

00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:08.500
to raise the dead,
or whatever?

00:00:08.583 --> 00:00:11.458
[Hector] The forgemaster
works through an instrument.

00:00:11.541 --> 00:00:13.458
That may be the worst
justification

00:00:13.541 --> 00:00:16.291
for a man holding his penis
that I've ever heard.

00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:17.791
Oh, my God.

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:19.833
And I am 200 years old.

00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:21.125
[sighs]
Look...

00:00:21.208 --> 00:00:22.625
I am a forgemaster.

00:00:22.708 --> 00:00:24.666
I didn't invent the name,
all right?

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.291
That's just what they call us.

00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:28.541
And the magic has to be focused
through an instrument,

00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:31.208
like breath being pushed
through a flute.

00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:33.791
This isn't getting any better.

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:36.208
I need the bloody hammer.
Is that better?

00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:37.791
So use a bloody hammer.

00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:40.375
There must be a thousand
bloody hammers around here.

00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:42.000
No, it's got to be special.

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:43.500
[scoffs]

00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:45.458
Your special hammer.

00:00:45.541 --> 00:00:47.083
[laughs]
Would you stop?

00:00:47.166 --> 00:00:48.708
It has to be made from scratch,

00:00:48.791 --> 00:00:50.375
in a very particular way,

00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:52.250
or else it won't work.

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:54.416
Like a flute with no holes.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.083
Right.

00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:58.166
-For fingering.
-[laughs]

00:00:58.250 --> 00:00:59.750
Would you stop?

00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:02.500
So when you blow it,
nothing comes out.

00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:03.916
Good god, woman.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.916
I'm bored, and it's fun
to horrify you.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.916
Indulge me.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.750
And think of something
to tell Carmilla.

00:01:10.833 --> 00:01:12.625
She's getting very cross.

00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:15.125
Oh, dear. How sad.

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.041
Never mind.

00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:18.916
Seriously.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.875
You've supposedly been making
your magic hammer for weeks.

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:25.333
Couldn't you make
something simpler?

00:01:25.416 --> 00:01:28.583
A stick, or a coin,
or something?

00:01:28.666 --> 00:01:30.458
We all use different things.

00:01:30.541 --> 00:01:32.791
Isaac used a knife.

00:01:32.875 --> 00:01:34.375
A hammer works better for me.

00:01:34.458 --> 00:01:37.958
Well, make it work faster.

00:01:38.041 --> 00:01:40.041
If Carmilla loses her temper,

00:01:40.125 --> 00:01:42.750
I won't be able to stand
in front of you for long.

00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:44.750
You'd stand in front of me?

00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:46.750
I've been doing it for weeks.

00:01:46.833 --> 00:01:48.875
Huh. Yes.

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:51.208
Yes, I suppose you have.

00:01:51.291 --> 00:01:53.625
Well, thank you.

00:01:53.708 --> 00:01:54.958
I'm working on it.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.416
You know what I'm going to say.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.666
Hmm.

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:01.250
Work faster.

00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:02.583
Yes.

00:02:02.666 --> 00:02:04.875
Yes, but it needs to be perfect,

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:08.250
or nothing will come out
of the end.

00:02:08.333 --> 00:02:10.583
Ugh, you're disgusting.

